    "text": "<p>If the integral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the range of <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is (where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;is an arbitrary constant)</p>\r",
