    "text": "<p>Let <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>;</mo></math> then,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Hence, range of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p>",
